"tokennya apa maniez" aria-required&gt;&#10; &lt;input type="hidden" name="score-phq" class="phq-score"&gt;&#10; &lt;input type="hidden" name="score-gad" class="gad-score"&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;button type="submit"&gt;Calculate score&lt;/button&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="likert-result" role="status" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Pawang Hujan: The Discord Bot that Helps You Hack The Cloud!</title><link>https://fidelyafr.fyi/project/ai/pawang-hujan/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://fidelyafr.fyi/project/ai/pawang-hujan/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="background"&gt;Background&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I took an NLP class in my senior year because I have nothing better to do and thought the course looked promising because of the whole AI advancement thingy nowadays. One of the projects being assigned to us is to make a simple regex-based pattern matching bot that responds to the user using some predefined answers. Kind of like a very simple helpdesk chatbot.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="what-is-pawang-hujan"&gt;What is Pawang Hujan?&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Pawang Hujan (Indonesian for rain shaman) is a Discord bot that I made to help people &lt;em&gt;hack the cloud.&lt;/em&gt; It serves as a simple chatbot assistant that helps me on my cloud pentesting journey. See it in action:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Database BSB: Full-stack Python Web-App for Bank Sampah Berseri</title><link>https://fidelyafr.fyi/project/backend/database-bsb/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://fidelyafr.fyi/project/backend/database-bsb/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="welcome"&gt;Welcome!&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This is the first in the &amp;ldquo;Community Service&amp;rdquo; series. Don&amp;rsquo;t worry, I didn&amp;rsquo;t break any law. It&amp;rsquo;s actually my university&amp;rsquo;s program and one of the requirements to get a diploma. Basically you volunteer for 2 months in a remote-ish village all across Indonesia and do some stuffs. Since I&amp;rsquo;m the IT guy, I do the village&amp;rsquo;s IT stuffs. One of them is this cool database I made for their &lt;em&gt;Bank Sampah&lt;/em&gt; (Waste Bank).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>CTU-13 Data Cleaning and Analysis: What Does The Malware Do?</title><link>https://fidelyafr.fyi/project/data/ctu-13/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://fidelyafr.fyi/project/data/ctu-13/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Coming soon!&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>